<div data-markup-content-target="1">For slightly more threat, hybrid gems can be swapped for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40141/guardians-dreadstone">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_40.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Guardian's Dreadstone</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40166/vivid-eye-of-zul">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_41.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vivid Eye of Zul</span></a> up to hit/<wbr/>expertise caps.</div></li>
<li class="fa fa-arrow-right">
<div data-markup-content-target="1">If hit or expertise caps are essential for you, substitute the ilvl 258 BiS items for high hit/<wbr/>expertise alternatives, such as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47939/endurance-of-the-infernal">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_41.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Endurance of the Infernal</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47952/sabatons-of-the-lingering-vortex">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_plate_06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sabatons of the Lingering Vortex</span></a>. More recommended swaps in the list below.</div></li></ul>
<div class="clear"></div></div>
<div id="tab-bis-nerubian-burrowers-swaps" style="display: none;">
<div style="text-align: -webkit-center;">
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="protection-warrior-phase-3-best-in-slotnerubian-burrowers-swaps">Protection Warrior - Phase 3 Best In Slot<br/>Nerubian Burrowers Swaps</h4>
<i>Since Blizzard changed the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/guide/raids/trial-of-the-crusader/anubarak-strategy">Anub'arak</a> encounter, there are no strict 101.6% avoidance sets needed to tank <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=34607/nerubian-burrower">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Nerubian Burrower</span></a>s anymore.<br/>Instead, use any good mitigation item you have, preferably low stamina ones, and spare items that can be repurposed with Nature Resistance enchants and defense gems to reduce incoming damage while also limiting your share of <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=66118/leeching-swarm">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_insectswarm.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leeching Swarm</span></a> healing.<br/>Below is a list of valuable items that can help reduce your stamina or reach the hit cap, and enchant examples to build your own set.</i></div>
