<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="emblems">Emblems of Triumph for Protection Warrior Tank in Phase 3</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47241/emblem-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Triumph</span></a> drop from the <b>10-man and 25-man</b> <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4722/trial-of-the-crusader">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Trial of the Crusader</span></a> bosses and can be exchanged for gear in <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4395/dalaran">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Dalaran</span></a>.<ul>
<li class="fa fa-warning">
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Do not buy the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item-set=-827">ilvl 232 T9 Set</a>.</b> The individual items are worse than the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item-set=-80">T8 Set</a> and, while the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=67273">4-piece set bonus</a> will sim as a small upgrade, it is not worth wasting your <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=301/emblem-of-triumph">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Triumph</span></span></a> on this. Instead, save your emblems to purchase the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item-set=-162">ilvl 245 T9 Set</a> when you receive some <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47242/trophy-of-the-crusade">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_trophy_argent.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Trophy of the Crusade</span></a>.</div></li></ul>Your first <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47241/emblem-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Triumph</span></a> should be saved up to buy your <b>4/<wbr/>5 <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item-set=-162">ilvl 245 T9 Set</a></b> as soon as you receive a <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47242/trophy-of-the-crusade">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_trophy_argent.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Trophy of the Crusade</span></a> from the 25-man version of <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4722/trial-of-the-crusader">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Trial of the Crusader</span></a>. The order in which you should buy <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48430">helm</a>, <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48454">shoulders</a>, <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48452">gloves</a> and <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48446">legs</a> will mostly depend on the upgrades you receive along the way. But, using the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-bis-gear-pve-phase-2">Phase 2 BiS</a> as a reference, you should buy the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48454">shoulders</a> first followed by the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48430">helm</a> <i>— both are BiS as individual items —</i> and end with <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48446">legs</a> and <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48452">gloves</a> which are technically downgrades to the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45594">ilvl</a> <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45487">252</a> <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4273/ulduar">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Ulduar</span></a> drops but will come ahead thanks to the excellent <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=67273">4-piece set bonus</a>.<br/>
<br/>Once you have acquired your <b>4/<wbr/>5 <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item-set=-162">ilvl 245 T9 Set</a></b>, or saved up 240 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=301/emblem-of-triumph">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Triumph</span></span></a> while you wait to receive your <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47242/trophy-of-the-crusade">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_trophy_argent.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Trophy of the Crusade</span></a>, the next best purchase is the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47735/glyph-of-indomitability">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_spiritshard_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Glyph of Indomitability</span></a>.<br/>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47735/glyph-of-indomitability">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_spiritshard_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Glyph of Indomitability</span></a> is a sleeper OP trinket. Most players would ignore it because it has no stam, but its enormous bonus armor actually makes for an excellent trinket to mitigate the damage taken and death probability against heavy physical hitters such as <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=32871/algalon-the-observer">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Algalon the Observer</span></a>, <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=34797/icehowl">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Icehowl</span></a> or <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=34564/anubarak">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Anub'arak</span></a>. On the other hand, it will prove rather weak against <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=34796/gormok-the-impaler">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Gormok the Impaler</span></a>, <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=34780/lord-jaraxxus">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Lord Jaraxxus</span></a> or <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=34497">Twin Val'kyr</a> so it's not the "equip and forget" kind of trinket.<br/>
<br/>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47660/blades-of-the-sable-cross">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_throwingaxepvp320_07.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Blades of the Sable Cross</span></a> are the BiS ranged weapon for this phase but the upgrade from <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45137/veranus-bane">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_rifle_31.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Veranus' Bane</span></a> is pretty small and poor value per emblem, so I recommend buying it last.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47731/clutch-of-fortification">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_50naxxramas.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Clutch of Fortification</span></a> is a decent ring on par with the best from last phase. The emblem <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47677">helm</a> and <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47698">shoulders</a> are decent items but both slightly worse than the T9 equivalent so I recommend against spending any emblem on them.<br/>
<br/>
<div style="text-align: -webkit-center;">
<table border="0" cellpadding="3" cellspacing="3" class="grid clean-markup-table-borders" style="width: 75%; max-width: 100%;">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td data-background="c1" style="width: 20%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Rank</b></td>
<td data-background="c1" style="width: 40%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Item</b></td>
<td data-background="c1" style="width: 40%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Price</b></td></tr>
<tr>
