<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Protection Warrior Tank in Phase 3</h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="head">Head for Protection Warrior Tank in Phase 3</h3>The ilvl 258 T9 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48433/wrynns-greathelm-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_23.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wrynn's Greathelm of Triumph</span></a> is the BiS helmet for Phase 3, followed by the ilvl 245 T9 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48430/wrynns-greathelm-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_23.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wrynn's Greathelm of Triumph</span></a>. They come with the highest item level for this phase, which means more item budget and especially stamina, but also a good selection of secondary stats with decent threat value despite being primarily mitigation-oriented items. <br/>
<br/>You will want to buy the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48430/wrynns-greathelm-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_23.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wrynn's Greathelm of Triumph</span></a>, paired with the shoulders, as soon as possible with your <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=301/emblem-of-triumph">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Triumph</span></span></a> to activate the strong <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=67269">2-piece set bonus</a> for the free threat increase without sacrificing any mitigation.<ul>
<li class="fa fa-lightbulb-o">
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<i>Once you acquire a <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47558/regalia-of-the-grand-protector">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_chain_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Regalia of the Grand Protector</span></a> to purchase the ilvl 258 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48433/wrynns-greathelm-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_23.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wrynn's Greathelm of Triumph</span></a>, your ilvl 245 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48430/wrynns-greathelm-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_23.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wrynn's Greathelm of Triumph</span></a> can be repurposed into a <b>Nature Resistance</b> helmet for <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=34564/anubarak">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Anub'arak</span></a>, with <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=44138/arcanum-of-toxic-warding">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_brewpoison.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of Toxic Warding</span></a> and <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=41396/eternal-earthsiege-diamond">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_shadowspirit_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Eternal Earthsiege Diamond</span></a>!</i></div></li></ul>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47677/faceplate-of-the-honorbound">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_25.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Faceplate of the Honorbound</span></a> is not a bad item in itself, but I can't recommend wasting any <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=301/emblem-of-triumph">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Triumph</span></span></a> for it until way later into the phase where it will become irrelevant.<br/>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=49479/helm-of-wrath">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_71.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Helm of Wrath</span></a> is a slight upgrade over the T8 helm as a standalone item, but not worth equipping if it would make you lose one of the T8 set bonuses.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Helm Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50369/arcanum-of-the-stalwart-protector">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_warrior_swordandboard.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of the Stalwart Protector</span></a> (more defense), <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=67839/mind-amplification-dish">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mind Amplification Dish</span></a> (more stamina)<div class="pad"></div>
