<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="shoulders">Shoulders for Protection Warrior Tank in Phase 3</h3>Similarly to the helm slot, the ilvl 258 T9 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48455/wrynns-pauldrons-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_20.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wrynn's Pauldrons of Triumph</span></a> is the BiS helmet for Phase 3, followed by the ilvl 245 T9 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48454/wrynns-pauldrons-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_20.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wrynn's Pauldrons of Triumph</span></a>, thanks to more item budget and more stamina. The shoulders slot comes with even better secondary stats, replacing SBV with expertise.<br/>You will want to buy helm + shoulders as soon as possible with your <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=301/emblem-of-triumph">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Triumph</span></span></a> to activate the strong <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=67269">2-piece set bonus</a>.<br/>
<br/>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47698/shoulderplates-of-enduring-order">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shoulderplates of Enduring Order</span></a> are not a bad item but, as with the helmets, a total waste of your <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=301/emblem-of-triumph">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Triumph</span></span></a> until it's basically no longer relevant.<br/>And the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47944/pauldrons-of-the-silver-defender">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_20.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pauldrons of the Silver Defender</span></a> are in the same boat as the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=49479/helm-of-wrath">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_71.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Helm of Wrath</span></a> seen above; a slight upgrade over the T8 shoulders as a standalone item, but not worth equipping if it would make you lose one of the T8 set bonuses.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Shoulder Inscription</b>: <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=44957/greater-inscription-of-the-gladiator">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_61.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greater Inscription of the Gladiator</span></a>
