<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="back">Back for Protection Warrior Tank in Phase 3</h3>The ilvl 272 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47549/magnis-resolution">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Magni's Resolution</span></a> is the best cloak for Phase 3. In fact, it's almost on par with the best cloak from next phase as well. It drops only from the <b>Tribute Chest</b> after defeating <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=34564/anubarak">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Anub'arak</span></a> in 25-man Heroic <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4722/trial-of-the-crusader">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Trial of the Crusader</span></a> with all 50 attempts left which is no small feat of strength. <br/>The next best thing, the ilvl 258 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48670/cloak-of-the-unflinching-guardian">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_18.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cloak of the Unflinching Guardian</span></a> is also obtained from the <b>Tribute Chest</b> with all 50 attempts left, but in the 10-man Heroic version of <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4722/trial-of-the-crusader">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Trial of the Crusader</span></a> this time. Both are quite difficult challenges and might take a few weeks for the average group to become familiar with the raid. <br/>
<br/>A much easier-to-obtain alternative is the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47063/pride-of-the-eredar">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pride of the Eredar</span></a> from <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=34780/lord-jaraxxus">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Lord Jaraxxus</span></a>, which is still a decent upgrade over the previous phase's BiS <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45496/titanskin-cloak">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_19.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Titanskin Cloak</span></a>, and also comes with expertise.<ul>
<li class="fa fa-lightbulb-o">
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<i>Whenever you upgrade your cloak, make sure to repurpose the previous one into a <b>Nature Resistance</b> item for <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=34564/anubarak">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Anub'arak</span></a>, with the <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=44494/enchant-cloak-superior-nature-resistance">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Cloak - Superior Nature Resistance</span></a>!</i></div></li></ul>
<b>Recommended BiS Cloak Enchant</b>: <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=41111/flexweave-underlay">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_22.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Flexweave Underlay</span></a>/<wbr/>
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=60663/enchant-cloak-major-agility">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Cloak - Major Agility</span></a>, <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=44591/enchant-cloak-titanweave">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Cloak - Titanweave</span></a> (defense)<div class="pad"></div>
