<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="chest">Chest for Protection Warrior Tank in Phase 3</h3>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46968/chestplate-of-the-towering-monstrosity">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate20.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Chestplate of the Towering Monstrosity</span></a> is on-par with the ilvl 258 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48451/wrynns-breastplate-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_25.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wrynn's Breastplate of Triumph</span></a>, trading parry for the superior expertise. But more importantly, it's an ilvl 258 chest that doesn't require a <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47558/regalia-of-the-grand-protector">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_chain_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Regalia of the Grand Protector</span></a> which makes it the ideal off-set item to complete the 4/<wbr/>5 T9 set.<br/>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48451/wrynns-breastplate-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_25.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wrynn's Breastplate of Triumph</span></a> remains the best mitigation item of the two and worth picking up eventually for next phase's progression, in case you end up with spare <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47558/regalia-of-the-grand-protector">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_chain_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Regalia of the Grand Protector</span></a> later in the phase. <br/>
<br/>In the meantime, the ilvl 245 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46962/chestplate-of-the-towering-monstrosity">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate20.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Chestplate of the Towering Monstrosity</span></a> is the best overall chest. The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47964/chestguard-of-the-warden">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_23.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Chestguard of the Warden</span></a> and the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48450/wrynns-breastplate-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_25.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wrynn's Breastplate of Triumph</span></a> are also excellent mitigation alternatives and strong upgrades to the T8 chest, although the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45334/unbreakable-chestguard">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate20.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Unbreakable Chestguard</span></a> from <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4273/ulduar">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Ulduar</span></a> is still relevant in that role.<br/>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47591/breastplate-of-the-white-knight">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_24.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Breastplate of the White Knight</span></a> is also a solid contender but, frankly, far too expensive of a <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=67091">craft</a> to be worth considering when so many alternatives exist. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Chest Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=60692/enchant-chest-powerful-stats">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Chest - Powerful Stats</span></a>, <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=47766/enchant-chest-greater-defense">
