<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="wrist">Wrist for Protection Warrior Tank in Phase 3</h3>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47111/bracers-of-the-shieldmaiden">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_31.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bracers of the Shieldmaiden</span></a> are the only ilvl 258 bracers for this phase and a default BiS. They come with good secondary stats and some welcomed expertise. <br/>
<br/>As a second pick you'll find the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47918/dreadscale-armguards">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_32.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dreadscale Armguards</span></a>, with similar stats distribution but hit instead of expertise, which may be more valuable depending on what you're missing most in the rest of your gear set. The crafted <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47570/saronite-swordbreakers">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_32a.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Saronite Swordbreakers</span></a> are almost identical, if you're in a hurry and would rather spend money for the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=67092">craft</a> right away.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Bracer Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=62256/enchant-bracers-major-stamina">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Bracers - Major Stamina</span></a>, <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=57690/fur-lining-stamina">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_leatherworking.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fur Lining - Stamina</span></a> (Leatherworker only)<div class="pad"></div>
