<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="hands">Hands for Protection Warrior Tank in Phase 3</h3>The ilvl 258 T9 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48453/wrynns-handguards-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_62.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wrynn's Handguards of Triumph</span></a> are the best gloves for Phase 3, although not by a long shot. The previous phase BiS <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45487/handguards-of-revitalization">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_62.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Handguards of Revitalization</span></a> are still competitive as a standalone item, with an identical stats distribution but an additional socket.<br/>However, the excellent <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=67273">4-piece T9 set bonus</a> makes using 4/<wbr/>5 T9 a no-brainer and multiplies the value of the ilvl 245 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48452/wrynns-handguards-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_62.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wrynn's Handguards of Triumph</span></a> when combined with the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48446">legs</a>, despite being a downgrade at first glance.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Glove Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=63770/reticulated-armor-webbing">
