<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_49c.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Girdle of the Nether Champion</span></a> have the same stat distribution but in lower quantity and are just sidegrades to the strong <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45139/dragonslayers-brace">
