<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="legs">Legs for Protection Warrior Tank in Phase 3</h3>The ilvl 258 T9 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48447/wrynns-legguards-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_24.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wrynn's Legguards of Triumph</span></a> are BiS by virtue of their high item level, but the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=67273">4-piece T9 set bonus</a> is the real value here.<br/>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47061/legguards-of-feverish-dedication">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_20.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Legguards of Feverish Dedication</span></a> could make for a compelling off-set, with a bigger item budget and an additional socket. However, tank items in Phase 3 come with an abundance of expertise but few of the BiS items provide hit rating, which makes the T9 legs a more desirable piece. <br/>
<br/>Legs are a similar case to gloves this phase. There are alternatives with better stats than the ilvl 245 T9 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48446/wrynns-legguards-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_24.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wrynn's Legguards of Triumph</span></a> as standalone items, including the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45594/legplates-of-the-endless-void">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_20.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Legplates of the Endless Void</span></a> from last phase, but once you can combine the T9 legs and gloves to activate the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=67273">4-piece set bonus</a>, their combined mitigation score is multiplied far beyond the difference in item level and raw stats. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Leg Enchant:</b> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=38373/frosthide-leg-armor">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_armorkit_32.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Frosthide Leg Armor</span></a>
