<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="jewelry">Jewelry for Protection Warrior Tank in Phase 3</h2>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="neck">Neck for Protection Warrior Tank in Phase 3</h3>Neck options are similar to boots in Phase 3. There are only 2 minor upgrades to last phase's BiS <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45485/bronze-pendant-of-the-vanir">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_47.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bronze Pendant of the Vanir</span></a>, both worth having in your bags; <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47133/the-arbiters-muse">
