<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="weapons">Weapons and Offhands for Protection Warrior Tank in Phase 3</h2>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="main-hand">One-Handed Weapons for Protection Warrior Tank in Phase 3</h3>As far as tank weapons go, there isn't anything exciting in Phase 3. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47506/silverwing-defender">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_145.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Silverwing Defender</span></a> is merely a sidegrade to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45442/sorthalis-hammer-of-the-watchers">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_91.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sorthalis, Hammer of the Watchers</span></a>, trading expertise for dodge in equal amount and still coming out behind on threat despite the higher item level and DPS. A good pick for an all-mitigation weapon to enchant with <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=27984/enchant-weapon-mongoose">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Mongoose</span></a> or <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=64579/enchant-weapon-blood-draining">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_note_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Blood Draining</span></a> to be extra safe, but overall a disappointing "phase BiS" after the item level boost on <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4273/ulduar">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Ulduar</span></a> items.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47967/crusaders-glory">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_145.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Crusader's Glory</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48714/honor-of-the-fallen">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_105.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Honor of the Fallen</span></a> are very small mitigation upgrades to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45876/shiver">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_90.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shiver</span></a>, although some may still prefer the latter for its hit rating anyway. Plus, it can now be acquired in Defense Protocol Beta heroics with <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=2589/sidereal-essence">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_icediamond_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sidereal Essence</span></span></a> and is a fantastic catch-up weapon.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=49495/burnished-quelserrar">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Burnished Quel'Serrar</span></a> is a decent catch-up weapon but nothing special. The iconic <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=69208/sanctuary">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_sealoffire.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sanctuary</span></a> proc makes up for the absence of secondary stats on the item, positioning it between <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47506/silverwing-defender">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_145.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Silverwing Defender</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47967/crusaders-glory">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_145.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Crusader's Glory</span></a> as far as mitigation goes. But the lack of strength and gem socket completely offset the overall value of the item. <br/>
<br/>Once again, there is no "tank" axe for the <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=46860/unrelenting-assault">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_warrior_unrelentingassault.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Unrelenting Assault</span></a> enthusiasts in P3. There are, however, some pretty strong slow and fast DPS axes but I'd rather not receive more threats in DMs so you didn't hear it from me.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Weapon Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=59619/enchant-weapon-accuracy">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Accuracy</span></a> (Threat), <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=27984/enchant-weapon-mongoose">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Mongoose</span></a> (Mitigation)<div class="pad"></div>
