<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="ranged">Ranged Weapons for Protection Warrior Tank in Phase 3</h3>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47660/blades-of-the-sable-cross">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_throwingaxepvp320_07.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Blades of the Sable Cross</span></a> is the only ranged weapon with tank stats in Phase 3 and the only upgrade to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45137/veranus-bane">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_rifle_31.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Veranus' Bane</span></a>, if you don't want to step on any toes by competing on the ilvl 258 <a class="icontiny c3" data-entity="class" data-game="wow" data-type="class" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/hunter">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_hunter.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hunter</span></a> weapons.<br/>It's purchased with <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=301/emblem-of-triumph">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Triumph</span></span></a> so no luck involved. However, it's a minuscule upgrade to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45137/veranus-bane">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_rifle_31.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Veranus' Bane</span></a> so best saved for last, since you will need a lot of <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=301/emblem-of-triumph">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Triumph</span></span></a> for more important upgrades this phase. <br/>
<br/>
